{{#> layout}}
<div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); padding: 40px 20px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;">
  <h1 style="color: white; margin: 0; font-size: 32px;">🎉 Welcome to BlackPot!</h1>
  <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); margin-top: 10px; font-size: 16px;">Your Restaurant Management Solution</p>
</div>

<div style="padding: 40px; background: #f9f9f9;">
  <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #333; margin-top: 0;">
    <strong>Hi {{userName}},</strong>
  </p>

  <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #555; line-height: 1.6;">
    Welcome to the BlackPot family! We're excited to have you on board. Your restaurant management platform is now active and ready to streamline your operations.
  </p>

  <h2 style="color: #667eea; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 30px;">Here's What You Can Do:</h2>
  
  <ul style="font-size: 15px; color: #555; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 20px;">
    <li><strong>📊 Dashboard</strong> - Monitor your restaurant's KPIs and performance metrics in real-time</li>
    <li><strong>🍽️ Menu Management</strong> - Create and organize your menu items with ease</li>
    <li><strong>💰 Orders & Payments</strong> - Process orders and payments seamlessly</li>
    <li><strong>📈 Inventory Tracking</strong> - Keep track of stock levels and supplier information</li>
    <li><strong>👥 Staff Management</strong> - Manage shifts, roles, and staff performance</li>
    <li><strong>📅 Reservations</strong> - Handle table reservations and customer preferences</li>
    <li><strong>📧 Communications</strong> - Stay connected with automated alerts and reports</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 style="color: #667eea; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 30px;">Getting Started:</h2>

  <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #555; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <a href="{{loginUrl}}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 30px; background: #667eea; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold;">Log In to BlackPot</a>
  </p>

  <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #888;">
    New to BlackPot? Check out our <a href="{{helpCenter}}" style="color: #667eea; text-decoration: none;">Help Center</a> for tutorials and documentation.
  </p>

  <h2 style="color: #667eea; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 30px;">Need Support?</h2>

  <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #555; line-height: 1.6;">
    Our support team is here to help. Visit our <a href="{{helpCenter}}" style="color: #667eea; text-decoration: none;">Help Center</a> or reach out to us with any questions.
  </p>

  <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; margin: 30px 0;">

  <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #888; margin-bottom: 0;">
    <strong>Happy managing!</strong><br>
    The BlackPot Team
  </p>
</div>

{{/layout}}
